<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-WINNERS OF THE NBA MOST IMPROVED PLAYER AWARD.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-WINNERS OF THE NBA MOST IMPROVED PLAYER AWARD.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>History of winners of the NBA</p>
<p>Most Improved Player Award, following announcement of Miami</p>
<p>Heat centre Issac Austin as 1996-97 recipient on Saturday:</p>
<p>1996-97 -- Isaac Austin, Miami Heat</p>
<p>1995-96 -- Gheorghe Muresan, Washington Bullets</p>
<p>1994-95 -- Dana Barros, Philadelphia 76ers</p>
<p>1993-94 -- Don MacLean, Washington Bullets</p>
<p>1992-93 -- Chris Jackson, Denver Nuggets</p>
<p>1991-92 -- Pervis Ellison, Washington Bullets</p>
<p>1990-91 -- Scott Skiles, Orlando Magic</p>
<p>1989-90 -- Rony Seikaly, Miami Heat</p>
<p>1988-89 -- Kevin Johnson, Phoenix Suns</p>
<p>1987-88 -- Kevin Duckworth, Portland Trail Blazers</p>
<p>1986-87 -- Dale Ellis, Seattle SuperSonics</p>
<p>1985-86 -- Alvin Robertson, San Antonio Spurs</p>
